    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Progress Sheets Change Alerts\nBranch 1 (webhook, POST /lab-changes): the Google Apps Script sends each edit as JSON {sheet_name, cell, old_value, new_value, editor_email, file_url, timestamp} with header x-secret. Wrong/missing secret -> 401. Valid -> appended to the \"Changes Log\" tab with notified = FALSE, then 200 {ok:true}.\nBranch 2 (daily 18:00 Africa/Cairo): reads Changes Log, takes rows where notified is not TRUE, groups by sheet and editor, optional Gemini summary (non-blocking), sends Telegram (split under 4096 chars) and optional Gmail, then sets notified = TRUE. No changes -> nothing is sent.\nRows are matched on row_number (the sheet row), which is unique and survives through the digest.\n\nConfigure:\n- Replace YOUR_SHARED_SECRET in \"Secret Header Valid?\" (same value as in the Apps Script).\n- Replace YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID and YOUR_PROFESSOR_EMAIL; pick the \"Lab Assistant\" spreadsheet (YOUR_SHEET_ID) in every Sheets node.\n- Use the PRODUCTION webhook URL (publish the workflow) in the Apps Script.\n- Delete/disable the Gmail node if you only want Telegram.\n- Set the workflow timezone to Africa/Cairo.\n- Attach the Error Alert workflow in Settings > Error workflow.\n\n---\nThis template was made by Basmala Taha",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "1892938f-277d-47f9-9ab2-95fb686afa18",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
